        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"/><path d="M22 4L12 14.01l-3-3"/></svg>
            <h3 style="font-family:'Manrope',sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0;">
                Getting Started
